{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再拿没想清楚拖住自己，先接下眼前能做的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼前能做的事\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍没底，却不再只算值不值得，愿意尽力、再多给一些，做起来也觉得痛快、有劲和骄傲。\",\n      \"key\": \"再多给一些\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着那些珍惜的东西，却再不能像从前那样自然地拥有它们，也说不清该怎么靠近。\",\n      \"key\": \"自然地拥有\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他努力维持镇定，越想藏住动摇，越显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"藏住动摇\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R5\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再等到彻底想清才行动、先承担眼前能做的事，并用S01-4的自责解释这一步变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R6\",\n        \"R7\",\n        \"R8\",\n        \"R9\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-2\",\n        \"S02-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并疑虑未消、行动带来力量与骄傲、不再只算值不值得，并补回愿意再多给一些。保留行动本身的痛快，不再把投入写成失落已经有了出口或越投入越畅快；把不再审视自己的说法改成费力维持镇定、越想藏住动摇越显出在意，以贴合B4。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R10\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把尚未得到照顾的牵挂写成仍惦记珍惜之物、却无法再自然拥有，也不知道如何靠近。改用S01-3作为前因，因为他先前已经说不清自己舍不得什么；不再用S01-1的过去回不来直接解释全部感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R7\",\n        \"R9\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留外在挺立与内心在意同时存在的心理事实，但不再把珠子中反复说服自己的比喻写成他真的一遍遍自言自语。删去前版重复S01-2的垮下去、重复S02-3的牵挂仍在，以及重复S02-2的心里没底等内容。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6cbe3a8e-5591-421b-8ec9-6219eed3ed91", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T170001938412Z", "elapsed_seconds": 606.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:10:08.781286+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "88431bc673ab4501cc32b47cdb3b2a3a25a9ee62c76490137a1abbaa19543f5a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response"